A comma, parenthesis, exclamation mark, question mark or spaced hyphen in what the
subject says. A conventional prefix may hold parentheses and a bang.
-- hit/commit-message --
keep the key, stable
keep the key (stable)
keep the key!
keep the key?
keep the key - stable
feat: drop the flag!
-- pass/commit-message --
keep the key; leave the lock
feat(cache): keep the key
feat!: drop the flag
feat(cache)!: drop the flag
